     1933   "ППП", 2,
     1934   "РКО", 3,
     1935   "ПКО", 4,
     1936   "Рс.АПЗ", 5,
     1937   "Пр.АПЗ", 6
     1938        SIZE 9.5 BY 4.21 TOOLTIP "Тип платежа" NO-UNDO.
     1939   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-8
     1940        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
     1941        SIZE 97.38 BY 2.75.
     1942   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-9
     1943        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE  NO-FILL
     1944        SIZE 97.38 BY 7.67.
