     1950        LABEL "Поставки через Диадок"
     1951        VIEW-AS TOGGLE-BOX
     1952        SIZE 24.5 BY .83 NO-UNDO.
     1953   DEFINE VARIABLE T-edi AS LOGICAL INITIAL no
     1954        LABEL "Поставки через ЭДО"
     1955        VIEW-AS TOGGLE-BOX
     1956        SIZE 21.5 BY .83 NO-UNDO.
