     1958        LABEL "Электронные заказы EDI"
     1959        VIEW-AS TOGGLE-BOX
     1960        SIZE 24.5 BY .83 NO-UNDO.
     1961   DEFINE QUERY Dialog-Frame FOR
     1962         contract SCROLLING.
     1963   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
     1964        b-OK AT ROW 1 COL 1
     1965        b-exit AT ROW 1 COL 11
