     1974        T-diadoc AT ROW 1.88 COL 70 WIDGET-ID 14
     1975        T-edi-order AT ROW 2.63 COL 70 WIDGET-ID 16
     1976        contract-prn-code AT ROW 3.58 COL 2.5 COLON-ALIGNED
