     2607   ON LEAVE OF cli-code IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2608   DO:
     2609     if cli-code = int ( cli-code:screen-value ) then return.
     2610     assign cli-code.
     2611     run find-cli in this-procedure (input 1, input cli-type, input cli-code)  .
     2612   END.
