     2751   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF RADIO-SET-1 IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2752   DO:
     2753     assign RADIO-SET-1 .
     2754     find first ub.fin-code-an-uchet no-lock where ub.fin-code-an-uchet.fin-code = a-code-an-uchet [RADIO-SET-1] and ub.fin-code-an-uchet.host-code = p-host-code no-error .
     2755     if available ub.fin-code-an-uchet then  assign an-uchet = ub.fin-code-an-uchet.code-value + "  " + ub.fin-code-an-uchet.descr  .
     2756     else assign an-uchet = "" .
     2757     find first ub.fin-code-cel-nazn no-lock where ub.fin-code-cel-nazn.fin-code  = a-code-cel-nazn [RADIO-SET-1] and ub.fin-code-cel-nazn.host-code = p-host-code no-error .
     2758     if available ub.fin-code-cel-nazn then assign cel-nazn = ub.fin-code-cel-nazn.code-value + "  " + ub.fin-code-cel-nazn.descr .
     2759     else assign cel-nazn = "" .
     2760     find first ub.fin-code-cor-acc no-lock where ub.fin-code-cor-acc.fin-code  = a-code-cor-acc [RADIO-SET-1]and ub.fin-code-cor-acc.host-code = p-host-code no-error .
     2761     if available ub.fin-code-cor-acc  then assign cor-acc = ub.fin-code-cor-acc.code-value + "  " + ub.fin-code-cor-acc.descr .
     2762     else assign cor-acc = "" .
     2763     find first ub.fin-code-cor-acc no-lock where ub.fin-code-cor-acc.fin-code  = a-code-cor-acc-2 [RADIO-SET-1]and ub.fin-code-cor-acc.host-code = p-host-code no-error .
     2764     if available ub.fin-code-cor-acc  then assign   cor-acc-2 = ub.fin-code-cor-acc.code-value + "  " + ub.fin-code-cor-acc.descr .
     2765     else assign cor-acc-2 = "" .
     2766     display cor-acc-2 cor-acc cel-nazn an-uchet with frame Dialog-Frame.
     2767     if RADIO-SET-1 > 2 then ENABLE  b-cor-acc-2 WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     2768     else  DISABLE  b-cor-acc-2 WITH FRAME Dialog-Frame.
     2769   END.
     2770   ON VALUE-CHANGED OF T-diadoc IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     2771   DO:
